#question(title: [Composition of one-to-one functions])[
  Assume for simplicity that all functions in
  this problem have domain $RR$. Prove the
  following theorem.

  #v(1fr)

  #slide-block(title: [Theorem A])[
    Let $f$ and $g$ be functions.  \
    IF $f$ and $g$ are one-to-one,  \
    THEN $f circle.small g$ is one-to-one.
  ]

  #v(1fr)

  Suggestion:
  + Write the definition of what you want to
    prove.
  + Figure out the formal structure of the
    proof.
  + Complete the proof (use the hypotheses!)
]
